  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU4Reconstruction - workstream 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Team Europe initiative EU4Reconstruction aligns sustainable reconstruction with creating pathways for EU accession. By supporting Ukraine&#x2019;s public administration through capacity-building for reconstruction and recovery as well compliance with EU rules and standards for accession. To this end, the Danish-led workstream for EU4Reconstruction will focus on The State Agency for Restoration and Infrastructure Development of Ukraine (SARDI) and support to larger cities, continuing previous Danish-led EUACI work in these areas.</narrative>
  </description>
